% BibTeX citations for the post-quantum (PQ) cryptography support added to
% the Mozilla SSL Configuration Generator.
%
% This file collects the normative specifications, library release notes,
% and authoritative blog posts that justify the PQ key-exchange groups
% and modes (Non-PQ / Hybrid / PQ Only) emitted by the generator.
%
% See also:
%   - GitHub issue mozilla/ssl-config-generator#342
%     ("Disables post-quantum")
%   - src/js/state.js (PQ mode logic)
%   - src/js/helpers/opensslcnf.js (openssl.cnf snippet)

